                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>John Morgan was a Bristol lawyer who befriended <persName key="COL01">Coleridge</persName> in 1807.  He was married to <persName key="MOR07">Mary Morgan</persName> who also appears in the diary.</p>
                        <p>J J Morgan, and some instances of Morgan (when in asociation with Coleridge or Lamb) have been identified as John Morgan.</p>
                        <p>Other occurrences of Morgan in the diary may correspond to John..</p>
                    </note>
                    <bibl type="printedbook">Richard Holmes, <title>Coleridge: Early Visions</title>, London, Penguin, 1989</bibl>
                    <bibl type="printedbook">Richard Holmes, <title>Coleridge: Darker Reflections</title>, London, Harper Collins, 1998</bibl>
